+ \Gamma(\wg)&=\Gamma_0\left[\left(\frac{f_{\mathrm B}(\wg)}{f_{\mathrm{B0}}}\right)^2+\alpha_\Gamma\wg\right],\label{eq:linewidth_model}\\
